{"title": "Shar's Protection", "pageid": 30416, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shar's_Protection", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Shar's Protection</b> is a passive feature that further enhances Shield of Faith.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While the wearer has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_Faith_(Condition)\" title=\"Shield of Faith (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shield of Faith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Shield_of_Faith_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_Faith_(Condition)\" title=\"Shield of Faith (Condition)\">Shield of Faith</a> active, reduce all incoming damage by 2 and reflect damage received back at the attacker, who takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_(Very_Rare)\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Half-Plate (Very Rare)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_(Very_Rare)\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Half-Plate (Very Rare)\">Dark Justiciar Half-Plate</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>If a wearer of this item casts <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Warding_Bond\" title=\"Warding Bond\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/20px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/30px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/40px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Warding Bond\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/20px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Warding_Bond\" title=\"Warding Bond\">Warding Bond</a> on an ally while <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sharran_Retribution_(Condition)\" title=\"Sharran Retribution (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sharran Retribution\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sharran_Retribution_(Condition)\" title=\"Sharran Retribution (Condition)\">Sharran Retribution</a> is active, taking damage may trigger an <i>infinite necrotic damage loop</i>. This loop continues until either the ally or the caster dies; however, if both characters have enough Hit Points to survive the cycle for an extended period, the game will likely freeze or crash.</li>\n<li>Even though <b>Shar's Protection</b> is not listed as a passive feature with <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_(Rare)\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Half-Plate (Rare)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/16/Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Half-Plate_(Rare)\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Half-Plate (Rare)\">Dark Justiciar Half-Plate (Rare)</a>, casting <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shar%27s_Aegis\" title=\"Shar's Aegis\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp/20px-Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp/30px-Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp/40px-Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shar's Aegis\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp/20px-Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Shield_of_Faith_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shar%27s_Aegis\" title=\"Shar's Aegis\">Shar's Aegis</a> with that armour equipped still applies <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sharran_Retribution_(Condition)\" title=\"Sharran Retribution (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sharran Retribution\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sharran_Retribution_(Condition)\" title=\"Sharran Retribution (Condition)\">Sharran Retribution</a> to the wearer.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202436\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.071 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2724/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26527/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11184/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip po